  "html": "<section class=\"slide dark slide--end\"><div class=\"grove-num\">12</div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"kicker\" data-anim=\"fade-in\" data-delay=\"0\">\n          [Organization]\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"rule\" data-anim=\"reveal-right\" data-delay=\"1\"></div>\n\n        \n        <h1\n          class=\"h1\"\n          style=\"max-width: 55%\"\n          data-anim=\"fade-up\"\n          data-delay=\"2\"\n        >\n          The work begins when the presentation ends.\n        </h1>\n\n        \n        <p\n          class=\"lead muted\"\n          style=\"max-width: 45%\"\n          data-anim=\"fade-up\"\n          data-delay=\"3\"\n        >\n          [Author Name] · [author@organization.com] · [organization.com]\n        </p>\n\n        \n        <p\n          class=\"label muted\"\n          style=\"margin-top: var(--gap-lg)\"\n          data-anim=\"fade-in\"\n          data-delay=\"4\"\n        >\n          [Deck version] · [Date] · [Confidentiality note]\n        </p></section>"
